msgctxt "0x3d/35"
msgid "This structure does not evolve."
msgstr "Cette structure n'évolue pas."

msgctxt "0x3d/36"
msgid "Create statues on some plazas by increasing local land value."
msgstr ""
"Créer de statues sur certaines places en augmentant la valeur foncière "
"des terrains."

msgctxt "0x3d/37"
msgid "Increase the stature of a statue by raising local land value."
msgstr ""
"Accroître l'envergure des statues en augmentant la valeur foncière des "
"terrains."

msgctxt "0x3d/38"
msgid "This grand statue will remain as long as land value is high."
msgstr ""
"Cette importante statue subsistera tant que la valeur des terrains sera "
"élevée."

msgctxt "0x3d/39"
msgid ""
"This is the lowest state of development for this building. Increase "
"local land value to raise its stature."
msgstr ""
"C'est le stade primaire de la construction, augmentez la valeur "
"foncière locale pour l'améliorer."

msgctxt "0x3d/40"
msgid ""
"This is the second state of development for this building. Increase "
"local land value to raise its stature."
msgstr ""
"C'est le deuxième stade de la construction, augmentez la valeur "
"foncière locale pour l'améliorer."

msgctxt "0x3d/41"
msgid ""
"This is the third state of development for this building. Increase "
"local land value to raise its stature."
msgstr ""
"C'est le troisième stade de la construction, augmentez la valeur "
"foncière locale pour l'améliorer."

msgctxt "0x3d/42"
msgid ""
"This is the highest state of development for this building. Maintain "
"local land value to retain its stature."
msgstr ""
"C'est le stade ultime de la construction, maintenez la valeur foncière "
"locale pour le conserver."

msgctxt "0x3d/43"
msgid ""
"This building needs pipe access from a nearby reservoir, and sufficient "
"plebs to maintain that piping."
msgstr ""
"Ce bâtiment doit être raccordé à un réservoir proche, et suffisamment "
"de personnel pour l'entretenir."

msgctxt "0x3d/44"
msgid ""
"This market is hardly used at all. It needs good road access to local "
"dwellings."
msgstr ""
"Ce marché est à peine utilisé. Il faut un bon accès routier pour la "
"desserte locale."

msgctxt "0x3d/45"
msgid ""
"This market is used infrequently. It needs more access to a local "
"business."
msgstr ""
"Ce marché est peu utilisé. Il faut un meilleur accès pour le commerce "
"local."

msgctxt "0x3d/46"
msgid ""
"This market is used often. In a more developed area it will prosper "
"further."
msgstr ""
"Ce marché est souvent utilisé. Dans une zone plus développée, il "
"prospérera."

msgctxt "0x3d/47"
msgid ""
"This market is thriving. It has good road access to plenty of customers."
msgstr ""
"Ce marché est prospère. Son bon accès routier amène un importante "
"clientèle."

msgctxt "0x3d/48"
msgid "Output is at a maximum -- you cannot raise it any further!"
msgstr "Le rendement est au maximum -- vous ne pouvez l'augmenter !"

msgctxt "0x3d/49"
msgid ""
"Output could be raised by increasing the supply of raw materials from "
"your province."
msgstr ""
"Le rendement peut être augmenté en amenant de votre province, plus de "
"matières premières."

msgctxt "0x3d/50"
msgid "Output is suffering from excessive industry tax rates."
msgstr "Le rendement souffre d'un excès de taxes industrielles."

msgctxt "0x3d/51"
msgid ""
"Competition for customers in this line of business hampers its "
"profitability."
msgstr "La concurrence sur ce marché baisse sa rentabilité."

msgctxt "0x3d/52"
msgid ""
"Output could be raised by expanding export routes from your province."
msgstr ""
"Le rendement peut être amélioré en augmentant les voies d'exportation "
"de votre province."

msgctxt "0x3d/53"
msgid "Industry saturation is stifling this business' output."
msgstr ""
"La sur-concentration des industries étouffe le rendement de ce marché."

msgctxt "0x3d/54"
msgid "Lack of local access to a market is limiting business growth."
msgstr ""
"Le manque d'accès locaux à un marché limite la croissance des affaires."

msgctxt "0x3d/55"
msgid "Lack of any export market is limiting business growth."
msgstr ""
"Le manque de marché d'exportation limite la croissance des affaires."

msgctxt "0x3d/56"
msgid "This business has an insufficient local workforce."
msgstr "Ce secteur manque de main-d'oeuvre locale."

msgctxt "0x3d/57"
msgid "Output is limited at the moment by insufficient city-wide demand."
msgstr "Le rendement est actuellement limité par la faible demande urbaine."

msgctxt "0x3d/58"
msgid ""
"Fierce competition in this trade is severely affecting profitability."
msgstr ""
"La férocité de la concurrence dans ce marché affecte sérieusement sa "
"rentabilité."

msgctxt "0x3d/59"
msgid "FREE SLOT"
msgstr "ESPACE LIBRE"

msgctxt "0x3d/60"
msgid ""
"Local land value is too low to encourage this dwelling to grow any "
"further."
msgstr ""
"La valeur foncière est trop faible pour encourager la croissance "
"ultérieure de ce quartier."

msgctxt "0x3d/61"
msgid "Lack of a water supply is preventing this house from growing."
msgstr "L'absence de fourniture d'eau empêche cette maison de s'agrandir."

msgctxt "0x3d/62"
msgid "No access to a local forum is stopping this house from growing."
msgstr ""
"L'absence d'accès à un forum local empêche cette maison de s'agrandir."

msgctxt "0x3d/63"
msgid "No access to any nearby market limits this dwelling's evolution."
msgstr ""
"L'absence d'accès à un marché proche limite l'évolution de ce quartier."

msgctxt "0x3d/64"
msgid ""
"Close proximity to a business is limiting the development of this "
"dwelling."
msgstr ""
"La grande proximité d'une zone commerçante limite l'évolution de ce "
"quartier."

msgctxt "0x3d/65"
msgid ""
"This house is limited because it draws water from a primitive supply."
msgstr ""
"Cette maison est limitée parce qu'elle tire son eau d'une source "
"d'approvisionnement de base."

msgctxt "0x3d/66"
msgid "Lack of nearby baths prevents this house from growing."
msgstr "Le manque de bains proches empêche cette maison de s'agrandir."

msgctxt "0x3d/67"
msgid ""
"This dwelling does not have sufficient use of nearby entertainment "
"types to grow any further."
msgstr ""
"Ce quartier est trop éloigné des centres de loisirs pour s'agrandir."

msgctxt "0x3d/68"
msgid ""
"Close proximity to an army barracks limits the development of this "
"dwelling."
msgstr ""
"La grande proximité des casernes limite le développement de ce quartier."

msgctxt "0x3d/69"
msgid "Residents feel too insecure in this area for it to grow any further."
msgstr "L'insécurité de ce quartier en limite la croissance."

msgctxt "0x3d/70"
msgid ""
"Close proximity to a city wall limits the development of this dwelling."
msgstr ""
"La grande proximité d'un mur d'enceinte limite le développement de ce "
"quartier."

msgctxt "0x3d/71"
msgid ""
"Close proximity to a city gate limits the development of this dwelling."
msgstr ""
"La grande proximité d'une porte d'accès limite le développement de ce "
"quartier."

msgctxt "0x3d/72"
msgid "Lack of any nearby grammaticus prevents this house from growing."
msgstr ""
"L'absence de Classe de Grammaire proche empêche cette maison de "
"s'agrandir."

msgctxt "0x3d/73"
msgid ""
"Close proximity to a praefecture limits the development of this dwelling."
msgstr ""
"La grande proximité d'une préfecture limite le développement de ce "
"quartier."

msgctxt "0x3d/74"
msgid ""
"Insufficient city-wide hospital facilities affects this dwelling's "
"ability to grow further."
msgstr ""
"L'insuffisance de la couverture hospitalière affecte la croissance de "
"ce quartier."

msgctxt "0x3d/75"
msgid "Lack of a nearby rhetor prevents this house from growing."
msgstr ""
"L'absence de Classe de Rhétorique proche empêche cette maison de "
"s'agrandir."

msgctxt "0x3d/76"
msgid "Close proximity to a market limits the development of this dwelling."
msgstr ""
"La grande proximité d'un marché limite le développement de ce quartier."

msgctxt "0x3d/77"
msgid ""
"Residents need more security in this area for it to grow any further."
msgstr ""
"Plus de sécurité est nécessaire dans cette zone pour qu'elle s'agrandisse."

msgctxt "0x3d/78"
msgid ""
"Insufficient city-wide library facilities affect this dwelling's "
"ability to grow further."
msgstr ""
"Le rayonnement insuffisant de la bibliothèque affecte le développement "
"de ce quartier."

msgctxt "0x3d/79"
msgid "Growth of this building is hampered by being too near a business."
msgstr ""
"Le développement de ce bâtiment est entravé par la proximité d'une zone "
"de commerce."

msgctxt "0x3d/80"
msgid "A business in the vicinity of this building limits its development."
msgstr ""
"Un commerce dans le voisinage de ce bâtiment en limite le développement."

msgctxt "0x3d/81"
msgid "This is prime development land. Land value is at its maximum level."
msgstr ""
"Ceci est une terre au développement prometteur. Sa valeur foncière est "
"au maximum."

msgctxt "0x3d/82"
msgid "This building is operational."
msgstr "Ce bâtiment est opérationnel."

msgctxt "0x3d/83"
msgid ""
"This building is mothballed. Without access to a forum, most of your "
"city cannot find it."
msgstr ""
"Cette construction est suspendue. Sans accès à un forum, le bâtiment ne "
"peut être atteint."

msgctxt "0x3d/84"
msgid "No Hospital Cover"
msgstr "PAS de couverture hospitalière."

msgctxt "0x3d/85"
msgid "No Library Cover"
msgstr "PAS de couverture pédagogique."

msgctxt "0x3d/86"
msgid "Land value is too low. This dwelling is shrinking."
msgstr "Valeur trop basse. Quartier en décrépitude."

msgctxt "0x3d/87"
msgid ""
"Local land value has been increasing in this vicinity. This dwelling is "
"increasing to a higher level of development."
msgstr ""
"La valeur augmente dans le voisinage. Ce quartier atteint un niveau de "
"développement supérieur."

msgctxt "0x3d/88"
msgid "Road Access"
msgstr "Accès routier."

msgctxt "0x3d/89"
msgid "No Road Access"
msgstr "PAS d'Accès routier."

msgctxt "0x3d/90"
msgid "This building needs access to a road to function effectively."
msgstr "Ce bâtiment nécessite un accès routier pour être effectif."

