msgctxt "0x40/0"
msgid "There are no people in the vicinity."
msgstr "Il n'y a personne dans les environs."

msgctxt "0x40/1"
msgid "person in"
msgstr "personnes dans"

msgctxt "0x40/2"
msgid "people in"
msgstr "habitants dans"

msgctxt "0x40/3"
msgid "the vicinity."
msgstr "les environs."

msgctxt "0x40/4"
msgid "\"We hardly collect any tax from this district.\""
msgstr "\"Nous collectons à peine quelques taxes dans ce quartier.\""

msgctxt "0x40/5"
msgid "\"Many areas avoid paying their taxes.\""
msgstr "\"Bien des secteurs ne payent pas leurs taxes.\""

msgctxt "0x40/6"
msgid "\"Tax avoidance is a problem in the city.\""
msgstr "\"La fraude fiscale est un problème dans la cité.\""

msgctxt "0x40/7"
msgid ""
"\"There is no tax avoidance in the district, but our resources are "
"stretched.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Il n'y a pas de fraude fiscale dans la zone, mais nos ressources sont "
"maigres.\""

msgctxt "0x40/8"
msgid "\"We have a good knowledge of this area, but it could be improved.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Nous avons une bonne connaissance de cette zone, mais elle pourrait "
"être améliorée.\""

msgctxt "0x40/9"
msgid "\"We have excellent records for this district.\""
msgstr "\"Nous avons d'excellents résultats dans cette zone.\""

msgctxt "0x40/10"
msgid "\"There are too few people in this district to support our market.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Il y a trop peu d'habitants dans cette zone pour entretenir notre "
"marché.\""

msgctxt "0x40/11"
msgid ""
"\"We do a reasonable amount of trade with the people of this district.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Nous commerçons raisonnablement bien avec les habitants de cette zone.\""

msgctxt "0x40/12"
msgid ""
"\"We have enough customers from this district, but we need better access "
"to a business.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Nous avons suffisamment de clients ici,  mais nécessitons un meilleur "
"accès au marché.\""

msgctxt "0x40/13"
msgid ""
"\"Our market is very popular with the good people of this district.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Notre marché est très populaire auprès du bon peuple de cette zone.\""

msgctxt "0x40/14"
msgid "\"AAARGH -- The only good Roman is a DEAD Roman!\""
msgstr "\"AAARGH -- Un bon Romain est un Romain MORT !\""

msgctxt "0x40/15"
msgid "\"I can't talk now -- there's trouble in the city!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Je ne peux pas parler maintenant -- il y a des problèmes dans la Cité "
"!\""

msgctxt "0x40/16"
msgid "\"We have lamentably little access to this part of this city.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Nous avons un accès lamentablement restreint à cette partie de la "
"Cité.\""

msgctxt "0x40/17"
msgid "\"We have too few patrols in this part of the city.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Nous avons trop peu de patrouilles dans cette partie de la Cité.\""

msgctxt "0x40/18"
msgid ""
"\"We have good patrols in this district. We feel we have the area "
"secure.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Nous avons de bonnes patrouilles dans ce quartier, cette zone nous "
"semble sécurisée.\""

msgctxt "0x40/19"
msgid "\"I can't talk now -- the city is burning!\""
msgstr "\"Je ne peux pas parler maintenant -- la Cité est en feu !\""

msgctxt "0x40/20"
msgid ""
"\"This district will erupt in violence unless something is done about "
"it.\""
msgstr "\"Si rien n'est fait, la violence va exploser dans ce quartier.\""

msgctxt "0x40/21"
msgid ""
"\"There is much discontent in this district -- the area is a source of "
"trouble.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Le mécontentement est grand dans ce quartier -- cette zone est une "
"source de problèmes.\""

msgctxt "0x40/22"
msgid ""
"\"Not everybody in this district is happy -- I hear the occasional "
"rumors.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Tout le monde n'est pas content dans ce quartier -- J'entends parfois "
"des rumeurs.\""

msgctxt "0x40/23"
msgid ""
"\"Most people in this district are well-behaved and content with their "
"lot.\""
msgstr ""
"\"La plupart des habitants de ce quartier se comportent bien et sont "
"satisfaits de leur sort.\""

msgctxt "0x40/24"
msgid "\"This is a very law-abiding and peaceful district.\""
msgstr "\"C'est un quartier paisible et respectueux des lois.\""

msgctxt "0x40/25"
msgid ""
"\"There are too few workers in this district to maintain our industry.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Il y a trop peu de main-d'oeuvre dans ce quartier pour maintenir notre "
"industrie.\""

msgctxt "0x40/26"
msgid ""
"\"We could do with more people in this district to help build up our "
"industry.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Il nous faudrait plus d'hommes dans ce quartier pour développer notre "
"industrie.\""

msgctxt "0x40/27"
msgid ""
"\"Many of our workers live in this district, but they need better access "
"to a market.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Beaucoup de nos travailleurs vivent ici mais ils ont besoin d'un "
"meilleur accès à un marché.\""

msgctxt "0x40/28"
msgid "\"This is a popular location to live for many of our workers.\""
msgstr ""
"\"C'est un lieu d'habitat très populaire pour beaucoup de nos "
"travailleurs.\""

msgctxt "0x40/29"
msgid ""
"\"Well, wouldn't YOU riot if you had tax rates like we've had these "
"years?\""
msgstr ""
