msgctxt "0x50/1"
msgid ""
"It's time to build your city!  Remember that Temples guard the precious "
"Denarii in your treasury.  You should build some to keep it safe -- the "
"more temples you have, the less Denarii taken when one is robbed."
msgstr ""
"Il est temps de construire votre Cité ! N'oubliez pas que les Temples "
"gardent votre trésor. Vous devriez en construire plusieurs -- plus vous "
"avez de temples, moins vous perdrez de Denarii en cas de vol."

msgctxt "0x51/0"
msgid "Disease!"
msgstr "Epidémie !"

msgctxt "0x51/1"
msgid ""
"Due to poor sanitation and lack of hospital coverage, an epidemic has "
"broken out in the city.  Isolate the area to prevent contagion, but "
"remember -- an ounce of prevention equals a pound of cure!"
msgstr ""
"A cause de la mauvaise hygiène et du manque d'hôpitaux, une épidémie "
"est apparue. Isolez la zone, mais souvenez-vous -- Mieux vaut prévenir "
"que guérir !"

msgctxt "0x52/0"
msgid "Fire Alert!"
msgstr "Incendie !"

msgctxt "0x52/1"
msgid ""
"A fire has broken out somewhere in the city! It will quickly spread to "
"adjacent buildings, unless contained or put out by vigiles."
msgstr ""
"Le feu s'est déclaré quelquepart dans la Cité ! Il s'étendra "
"rapidement, tant qu'il ne sera pas contenu ou éteint par les vigiles."

msgctxt "0x53/0"
msgid "The City Is Attacked!"
msgstr "La Cité est attaquée !"

msgctxt "0x53/1"
msgid ""
"Enemies have reached the city -- it is sure to be sacked!  City walls "
"will only keep them at bay for a limited time -- soldiers will have to "
"meet the threat!"
msgstr ""
"Les ennemis ont atteint la Cité -- Elle sera pillée ! Les murs ne les "
"retiendront qu'un temps -- les soldats vont devoir combattre !"

msgctxt "0x54/0"
msgid "Another Year Passes"
msgstr "Une autre année passe"

msgctxt "0x54/1"
msgid "And you haven't been stabbed to death!"
msgstr "Et vous n'avez pas été assassiné !"

msgctxt "0x55/0"
msgid "Services Cut"
msgstr "Services Interrompus"

msgctxt "0x55/1"
msgid ""
"Due to a lack of Denarii spent on pleb welfare, the number of pleb "
"groups has fallen back such that for the first time, services to the "
"city have had to be lessened. This warning will only be given ONCE."
msgstr ""
"A cause d'un manque de Denarii dépensés pour les Plébéiens, leur nombre "
"est tellement faible que pour la première fois, les services urbains "
"ont été réduits."

msgctxt "0x56/0"
msgid "Stolen!"
msgstr "volés !"

msgctxt "0x56/1"
msgid ""
"Robbers have broken into one of your temples and stolen some of the "
"treasury. You need better security, or you do not have enough temples "
"to store your gold."
msgstr ""
"Des voleurs ont dérobé une partie du trésor dans un temple. Notre "
"conseil est de faire plus de patrouilles aux alentours des temples."

msgctxt "0x57/0"
msgid "Rioting!"
msgstr "Emeute !"

msgctxt "0x57/1"
msgid ""
"Mobs are forming in parts of the city.  Regardless of the cause -- high "
"taxes?  Conscription?  Unrest? -- their threat is clear."
msgstr ""
"Des émeutes se forment au travers de la Cité. Quelqu'en soit la cause "
"-- taxes élevées ? conscription ? troubles ? -- la menace est claire."

msgctxt "0x58/0"
msgid "Attempted Robbery"
msgstr "Tentative de Vol"

msgctxt "0x58/1"
msgid ""
"An attempt was made to steal your unprotected Denarii; fortunately, it "
"failed.  In the future, you may not be so lucky -- so build some "
"temples to hold the treasury and ensure adequate patrols in their "
"vicinity!"
msgstr ""
"On a tenté de voler vos Denarii non protégés ; heureusement, ils ont "
"échoué. A l'avenir, vous pourriez être moins chanceux -- alors "
"construisez des Temples pour garder votre trésor et assurez-vous de "
"patrouilles adéquates à leur proximité !"

msgctxt "0x59/0"
msgid "Stolen!"
msgstr "Volés !"

msgctxt "0x59/1"
msgid ""
"Thieves have run off with much of your treasury.  Leaving your Denarii "
"lying around on the floor of the Forum has proven to be a bad idea.  "
"Have you considered building some temples to store it?"
msgstr ""
"Les voleurs se sont enfuis avec grande part du trésor. Ne laissez plus "
"vos Denarii traîner n'importe où. Construire des temples pour les garder !"

msgctxt "0x5a/0"
msgid "Too many Cohorts!"
msgstr "Trop de Cohortes !"

msgctxt "0x5a/1"
msgid ""
"Your Legion can only be split into ten cohorts.  You cannot raise "
"another one."
msgstr "Dix Cohortes sont un maximum. Vous ne pouvez plus en lever aucune."

msgctxt "0x5b/0"
msgid "Raiders Sighted!"
msgstr "Pillards en vue !"

msgctxt "0x5b/1"
msgid ""
"A Barbarian raiding party has been sighted entering the province.  Your "
"outlying towns and villages will be at risk unless some action is taken."
msgstr ""
"Un raid barbare a été vu pénétrant dans la Province. Vos villes et "
"villages sont en danger tant que vous n'aurez pas agi en conséquence."

msgctxt "0x5c/0"
msgid "Local Uprising!"
msgstr "Soulèvement Local !"

msgctxt "0x5c/1"
msgid ""
"A village or town in your province has rejected Rome's right of "
"sovereignty.  The local officials have been killed and scouts report a "
"makeshift army is heading for the city!"
msgstr ""
"Un village ou une ville de votre Province a rejeté la souveraineté de "
"Rome. Les officiels locaux ont été assassinés et une armée de fortune "
"marche sur la cité !"

msgctxt "0x5d/0"
msgid "Barbarian Invasion!"
msgstr "Invasion Barbare !"

msgctxt "0x5d/1"
msgid ""
"A large barbarian horde is traveling towards your province, crushing "
"all before them.  They will surely head for the city!"
msgstr ""
"Un importante horde barbare traverse votre Province, détruisant tout "
"sur son passage. Ils attaqueront sans aucun doute la Cité !"

msgctxt "0x5e/0"
msgid "Enemy Invades!"
msgstr "Invasion Ennemie !"

msgctxt "0x5e/1"
msgid ""
"Worried at Rome's increasing influence in the area, your rivals have "
"launched an all-out attack.  Scouts report they are marching towards "
"your city at this very moment!"
msgstr ""
"Inquiet de l'influence croissante de Rome dans la région, vos rivaux "
"attaquent à outrance. Des éclaireurs ont rapporté qu'ils marchaient "
"déjà vers votre Cité !"

msgctxt "0x5f/0"
msgid "Walls Attacked!"
msgstr "Enceinte attaquée !"

msgctxt "0x5f/1"
msgid ""
"One of your provincial walls is under attack!  The defenders will try "
"to hold out for as long as possible, but without the assistance of a "
"Cohort they are hopelessly outnumbered!"
msgstr ""
"L'une de vos enceintes provinciales est attaquée ! Elle tiendra aussi "
"longtemps que possible, mais sans l'aide d'une Cohorte, ils seront "
"battus !"

msgctxt "0x60/0"
msgid "Defenses Breached!"
msgstr "Défenses enfoncées !"

msgctxt "0x60/1"
msgid "A portion of your provincial wall has been stormed by its besiegers!"
msgstr ""
"Une partie de votre enceinte provinciale a été détruite par les "
"assiégeants !"

msgctxt "0x61/0"
msgid "Illegal Order"
msgstr "Ordre Invalide !"

msgctxt "0x61/1"
msgid ""
"You cannot issue orders to a demobilized cohort, or to one that is "
"reported unfit for battle."
msgstr ""
"Vous ne pouvez donner des ordres à une cohorte démobilisée, ou non "
"prête au combat."

msgctxt "0x62/0"
msgid "No Denarii!"
msgstr "Plus de Denarii !"

msgctxt "0x62/1"
msgid ""
"You have exhausted the funds in your treasury.  The Emperor will cover "
"your accounts for some time, but you must return to a surplus of funds "
"soon."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez épuisé votre trésor. L'Empereur vous accorde quelques temps "
"pour revenir à une situation bénéficiaire, mais il vous surveille."

msgctxt "0x63/0"
msgid "Stern Warning"
msgstr "Avertissement Sévère"

msgctxt "0x63/1"
msgid ""
"The Emperor strongly suggests that you return to profitability.  There "
"are many Romans who would be willing to take over for a failing Governor!"
msgstr ""
"L'Empereur vous suggère ardemment de redresser la situation. Beaucoup "
"de Romains ne demandent pas mieux que de prendre votre place !"

msgctxt "0x64/0"
msgid "The Empire Expands!"
msgstr "L'Empire s'agrandit !"

msgctxt "0x64/1"
msgid ""
"Another province has been conquered by the mighty legion commanded by "
"the renowned Pompous Maximus.  The Senate in Rome has decreed a parade "
"of Triumph."
msgstr ""
"Un nouvelle province a été conquise les fières légions de Pompous "
"Maximus. Le Sénat de Rome a décidé un défilé de Triomphal."

msgctxt "0x65/0"
msgid "Insufficient Plebs"
msgstr "Pas assez de Plébéiens"

msgctxt "0x65/1"
msgid ""
"The Plebeian Tribune reports that you do not have enough able-bodied "
"plebs available to support construction activities."
msgstr ""
"Vous n'avez pas assez de population adéquate pour soutenir vos "
"activités de construction."

msgctxt "0x66/0"
msgid "Too Many Flags!"
msgstr "Trop de drapeaux !"

msgctxt "0x66/1"
msgid ""
"You have already placed the maximum available number of flags on this "
"map. To place a new flag, you must remove an old one first."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez déjà placé la totalité des indicateurs disponibles sur cette "
"carte. Retirez-en un ancien au préalable."

msgctxt "0x67/0"
msgid "No Flags"
msgstr "Pas d'indicateur"

msgctxt "0x67/1"
msgid "You do not have any flags of this type to view."
msgstr "Vous n'avez pas d'indicateur de ce type à visualiser."

msgctxt "0x68/0"
msgid "Good Going!"
msgstr "Bonne progression !"

msgctxt "0x68/1"
msgid ""
"Your city population has reached 200 for the first time in its history."
msgstr ""
"La population de votre Cité a atteint 200 habitants pour la première "
"fois de son histoire."

msgctxt "0x69/0"
msgid "Well Done!"
msgstr "Très Bien !"

msgctxt "0x69/1"
msgid ""
"Your city population has reached 500 for the first time in its history."
msgstr ""
"La population de votre Cité a atteint 500 habitants pour la première "
"fois de son histoire."

msgctxt "0x6a/0"
msgid "Congratulations!"
msgstr "Félicitations !"

msgctxt "0x6a/1"
msgid ""
"Your city population has reached 1,000 for the first time in its history."
msgstr ""
"La population de votre Cité a atteint 1000 habitants pour la première "
"fois de son histoire."

msgctxt "0x6b/0"
msgid "Congratulations!"
msgstr "Félicitations !"

msgctxt "0x6b/1"
msgid ""
"Your city population has reached 2,000 for the first time in its history."
msgstr ""
"La population de votre Cité a atteint 2000 habitants pour la première "
"fois de son histoire."

msgctxt "0x6c/0"
msgid "Congratulations!"
msgstr "Félicitations !"

msgctxt "0x6c/1"
msgid ""
"Your city population has reached 5,000 for the first time in its history!"
msgstr ""
"La population de votre Cité a atteint 5000 habitants pour la première "
"fois de son histoire."

msgctxt "0x6d/0"
msgid "Excellent!"
msgstr "Excellent !"

msgctxt "0x6d/1"
msgid ""
"Your city population has reached 10,000 for the first time in its history!"
msgstr ""
"La population de votre Cité a atteint 10000 habitants pour la première "
"fois de son histoire."

msgctxt "0x6e/0"
msgid "Incredible!"
msgstr "Fantastique !"

msgctxt "0x6e/1"
msgid ""
"Your city population has grown to 20,000 people for the first time in "
"its history!"
msgstr ""
"La population de votre Cité a atteint 20000 habitants pour la première "
"fois de son histoire."

msgctxt "0x6f/0"
msgid "Unbelievable!"
msgstr "Incroyable !"

msgctxt "0x6f/1"
msgid ""
"Your city population has grown to 30,000 people for the first time in "
"its history!"
msgstr ""
"La population de votre Cité a atteint 30000 habitants pour la première "
"fois de son histoire."

msgctxt "0x70/0"
msgid "Astounding!"
msgstr "Ahurissant !"

msgctxt "0x70/1"
msgid ""
"Your city population has grown to 40,000 people for the first time in "
"its history!"
msgstr ""
"La population de votre Cité a atteint 40000 habitants pour la première "
"fois de son histoire."

msgctxt "0x71/0"
msgid "Town captured!"
msgstr "Ville capturée !"

msgctxt "0x71/1"
msgid "Barbarians have looted and settled in one of your outlying towns!"
msgstr "Les Barbares ont pillé et colonisé une ville de votre Province !"

msgctxt "0x72/0"
msgid "Destruction!"
msgstr "Destruction !"

msgctxt "0x72/1"
msgid ""
"Barbarians are rampaging unchecked through the province -- your people "
"are frightened."
msgstr ""
"Les Barbares saccagent la province -- votre population est aux abois."

msgctxt "0x73/0"
msgid "New Structure Available"
msgstr "Nouvelle Structure Disponible"

msgctxt "0x73/1"
msgid ""
"The civil-engineering capacity of your city has risen high enough to "
"allow you to build this new structure!"
msgstr ""
"Le génie civil de votre Cité vous permet de construire cette nouvelle "
"structure !"

