msgctxt "help/58/0"
msgid "Battle (page 7)"
msgstr "Bataille (page 7)"

msgctxt "help/58/1"
msgid ""
"Select All: This button allows you to select all of your forces with a "
"single mouse click.\n"
"Retreat:  Select retreat to withdraw your forces from the battle. They "
"will disperse and regroup at their fort. This will be a serious blow to "
"morale, but may allow your troops to fight again another day. \n"
"Surrender: If you surrender, your troops will be entirely at the mercy "
"of the enemy. \n"
"\n"
"Auto:  Select this button if you would like to give up control of the "
"battle, and have its results calculated automatically for the remaining "
"forces.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"#50Previous Page#\n"
"#14Tips#"
msgstr ""
"Tout sélectionner: Ce bouton permet de sélectionner la totalité des "
"troupes d'un seul clic.\n"
"Retraite: Cliquez sur Retraite pour retirer vos forces de la bataille. "
"Elles se dispersent et se regroupent dans leurs forts. Ceci peut leur "
"porter un coup au moral mais leur permet de combattre un autre jour. \n"
"Reddition: Si vous vous rendez, vos troupes sont totalement à la merci "
"de l'ennemi.\n"
"\n"
"Auto:  Cliquez sur ce bouton pour abandonner le contrôle de la bataille "
"et avoir des résultats calculés en fonction des forces restantes.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"#50Page Précédente#\n"
"#14Trucs#"

