msgctxt "help/115/0"
msgid "Help with Rivers"
msgstr "Aide : Les Rivières"

msgctxt "help/115/1"
msgid ""
"Rivers provide water to your city by means of reservoirs, which feed "
"aqueducts and fountains. Rivers can also provide protection, as enemy "
"troops will not be able to cross them without bridges. When you begin "
"to design your city, consider the river both as a source of water and "
"as a protective barrier."
msgstr ""
"Les rivières fournissent de l'eau à votre cité par le biais des "
"réservoirs, qui alimentent les Aqueducs et les Fontaines. Elles offrent "
"aussi une protection, les troupes ennemies ne pouvant pas les traverser "
"sans pont. Lorsque vous commencez votre ville, considérez la rivière "
"comme une source d'eau et une barrière protectrice."

