msgctxt "help/235/0"
msgid "Worship"
msgstr "Le culte"

msgctxt "help/235/1"
msgid ""
"In addition to providing places of worship, religious buildings provide "
"secure storage for your treasury's gold. If your city begins to "
"accumulate wealth but has no religious buildings in which to secure it, "
"robberies are likely to occur. More wealth creates a need for more "
"religious buildings. Religious buildings come in three sizes: Shrine, "
"Temple, and Basilica, which increase in size, cost, and capacity "
"respectively. Since these buildings store valuables, be sure to build "
"them in places with high security levels (i.e. with road connections to "
"Barracks and Praefectures) or they may fall victim to crime.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"#1084Previous Page# / #42Next Page#\n"
"#236Tips# / #237History#"
msgstr ""
"En plus des lieux de culte, les constructions religieuses sont des "
"entrepôts sûrs pour votre or. Si votre cité commence à accumuler les "
"richesses sans avoir d'immeuble religieux pour les abriter, des vols "
"vont se produire. Les lieux de culte sont de trois types : le Lieu "
"Saint, le Temple et la Basilique qui croissent respectivement en "
"taille, coût et capacité. Ces immeubles abritant des valeurs, "
"assurez-vous qu'ils soient construits dans des endroits où le niveau de "
"sécurité est élevé (avec des routes menant aux casernes et aux "
"préfectures) pour qu'ils ne soient pas victimes du crime.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"#1084Page Précédente# / #42Page Suivante#\n"
"#236Trucs# / #237Histoire#"

msgctxt "help/236/0"
msgid "Tips for Worship"
msgstr "Trucs : le culte"

msgctxt "help/236/1"
msgid ""
"Building religious structures near barracks and praefectures is the "
"best way to stop robberies, but they will have little effect on housing "
"there.\n"
"\n"
"Remember that temples are a good way to increase land values for "
"housing when they already have all of their needs fulfilled.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"#235Help# / #237History#"
msgstr ""
"Construire les édifices religieux près des casernes et des préfectures "
"est la meilleure précaution contre le vol, mais ils auront un léger "
"effet sur l'habitat.\n"
"\n"
"N'oubliez pas que les Temples augmentent le coût foncier lorsque tous "
"les besoins des maisons sont satisfaits.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"#235Aide# / #237Histoire#"

