msgctxt "help/243/1"
msgid ""
"The Shrine is the least advanced type of religious building you may "
"construct. Like Temples and Basilicas, Shrines serve as secure storage "
"for your Denarii in addition to providing places of worship."
msgstr ""
"Le MAUSOLEE est le type d'édifices religieux le moins avancé que vous "
"pouvez construire. Comme les Temples et les Basiliques, les lieux "
"saints ajoutent la fonction de stockage des Deniers à celle de lieu de "
"culte."

