msgctxt "help/295/0"
msgid "Help with Gardens"
msgstr "Aide : Les jardins"

msgctxt "help/295/1"
msgid ""
"Building Gardens and Plazas will boost land values by providing "
"pleasant public places for your citizens. They will also help you to "
"raise your Culture rating. Sections of  Plaza also serve as sections of "
"road. \n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"#296Tips# / #297History#"
msgstr ""
"Construire des Jardins et des Places stimule le coût foncier en donnant "
"des lieux publics agréables. Ils participent à l'élévation du niveau "
"culturel. Des portions de places servent de routes. \n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"#296Trucs# / #297Histoire#"

msgctxt "help/296/0"
msgid "Tips for Amenities"
msgstr "Trucs : agréments"

msgctxt "help/296/1"
msgid ""
"Use gardens and plazas to improve land values around housing.  In "
"harder provinces or skill levels, they are a good way to keep tents "
"from disappearing.\n"
"\n"
"Place plazas with care, as your city's walkers are sometimes likely to "
"wander aimlessly around them. \n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"#295Help# / #297History#"
msgstr ""
"Utilisez les jardins et places pour accroître le coût foncier. Dans les "
"niveaux de jeu les plus difficiles, c'est un bon moyen d'éviter la "
"disparition des tentes.\n"
"\n"
"Attention à la situation des places, vos marcheurs peuvent parfois y "
"errer sans but. \n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"#295Aide# / #297Histoire#"

msgctxt "help/297/0"
msgid "Roman Gardens"
msgstr "Les Jardins"

msgctxt "help/297/1"
msgid ""
"Romans of all classes were in love with the country life, and wherever "
"possible sought to bring a little of it into the city itself.  As of  "
"270 AD, a full 7% of the city was covered by some kind of garden. Every "
"domus had its private interior garden, carefully groomed and maintained "
"by the house slaves.  The public gardens, called horti, were property "
"of the Emperor and used as parks.  These tiny pieces of rustica were "
"elaborately sculptured, though their designers attempted to strike a "
"balance between architectural elegance and the simple beauty of nature. "
" Flowers and aromatic herbs were grown in artistically arranged beds, "
"bushes and trees were cut and shaped into the forms of animals, and "
"artifical pools, \n"
"\n"
"#298Next Page#\n"
"#295Help#/#296Tips#"
msgstr ""
"Les Romains de toutes classes aimaient la vie campagnarde et, dès que "
"possible, ils cherchaient à l'introduire en ville. Vers 270, 7% de la "
"cité était couverte de jardins de toutes sortes.  Chaque Domus avait "
"son jardin intérieur privé, soigneusement entretenu par les esclaves de "
"la maison. Les jardins publics, appelés horti, étaient la propriété de "
"l'Empereur et utilisés comme parcs. Ces minuscules pièces rustiques "
"étaient minutieusement sculptées, bien que leurs créateurs cherchaient "
"une balance entre l'élégance architecturale et la simple beauté de la "
"nature. Les fleurs et les plantes aromatiques étaient piquées et "
"poussaient artistiquement, les buissons et les arbres étaient taillés "
"en forme d'animaux, on y trouvait des bassins\n"
"#298Page Suivante#\n"
"#295Aide#/#296Trucs#"

msgctxt "help/298/0"
msgid "Roman Gardens (cont.)"
msgstr "Les Jardins Romains (suite)"

msgctxt "help/298/1"
msgid ""
"waterfalls, and canals were constructed.  A few gardens had a portico, "
"a porch-like structure running around the outside wall so that the "
"garden could be enjoyed even in rain or the heat of the summer sun. \n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"#297Previous Page#\n"
"#295Help#/#296Tips#"
msgstr ""
"des chutes d'eau et des canaux. Des jardins avaient un portique, "
"structure en forme de porche longeant le mur d'enceinte de telle sorte "
"qu'on pouvait profiter du jardin par temps de pluie ou sous un soleil "
"d'été.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"#297Page Précédente#\n"
"#295Aide#/#296Trucs#"

