msgctxt "help/370/0"
msgid "Help with Wells"
msgstr "Aide : Les Puits"

msgctxt "help/370/1"
msgid ""
"A well is a cheap way to create a water supply for a relatively small "
"area. Wells do not create any pipe access. They can be built anywhere, "
"but they only supply a primitive water supply that will limit land "
"values.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"#371Tips# "
msgstr ""
"Le puits est un moyen économique d'alimenter en eau un espace "
"relativement petit. Il n'est pas accessible par des tuyaux. On peut les "
"construire n'importe où mais leur faible débit limite le coût foncier.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"#371Trucs# "

msgctxt "help/371/0"
msgid "Tips for Wells"
msgstr "Trucs : Puits"

msgctxt "help/371/1"
msgid ""
"If you're the unsavory sort that builds \"slums\" to supply businesses "
"with convenient workers, you may find wells to be a cheap source of "
"water for them.  Housing near businesses can't grow into mansions "
"anyway, so a primitive water supply shouldn't be of much concern. \n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"#370Help#"
msgstr ""
"Si vous êtes un de ces types qui construisent des \"taudis\" pour fournir "
"de la main d'oeuvres aux industries, le puits vous semblera tout à fait "
"convenable. Une construction près d'une manufacture ne deviendra pas un "
"palais alors rien ne peut lui être mieux adapté qu'un puits. \n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"#370Aide#"

