msgctxt "help/415/0"
msgid "Help for Towers"
msgstr "Aide : Les tours"

msgctxt "help/415/1"
msgid ""
"Towers strengthen walls, and serve as posts for soldiers. If invaders "
"enter the city, soldiers will emerge from your towers to counterattack. \n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"#416Tips# / #447 History#"
msgstr ""
"Les tours renforcent les murs et servent de postes aux soldats. En cas "
"d'invasion, les soldats sortent des tours pour contre-attaquer. \n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"#416Trucs# / #447 Histoire#"

msgctxt "help/416/0"
msgid "Tips for Towers"
msgstr "Trucs : Les tours"

msgctxt "help/416/1"
msgid ""
"If you sense that barbarians are always approaching your city from the "
"same directions, try building groups of towers along the walls that "
"they first hit.  Also make sure to build gates near the towers to give "
"your soldiers better access to the enemy. \n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"#415Help# / #447 History#"
msgstr ""
"Si vous sentez que les barbares viennent toujours des mêmes directions, "
"essayez de construire des groupes de tours le long des murs qu'ils "
"attaquent en priorité. N'oubliez pas de construire des portails près "
"des tours pour faciliter l'accès à l'ennemi pour les soldats. \n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"#415Aide# / #447 Histoire#"

