msgctxt "help/430/0"
msgid "Help with Gates"
msgstr "Aide: Portails"

msgctxt "help/430/1"
msgid ""
"Gates allow your people tomove through any walls you build. To build a "
"gate, just run a section of road through a wall, or vice versa.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"#431Tips# / #447History#"
msgstr ""
"Le portail permet aux gens de franchir les murs. Pour construire un "
"portail, faites passer une section de route sur un mur ou vice versa.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"#431Trucs# / #447Histoire#"

msgctxt "help/431/0"
msgid "Tips for Gates"
msgstr "Trucs: les portails"

msgctxt "help/431/1"
msgid ""
"If you have built a wall around your city, you can better defend it by "
"building a road just inside the wall, and placing barracks next to that "
"road at regular intervals.  Make sure you build gates on the road as "
"well, so that your soldiers can reach enemies before they enter the "
"city. \n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"#430Help# / #447History#"
msgstr ""
"Si vous avez construit un mur autour de la cité, vous la défendrez "
"mieux en plaçant une route à l'intérieur du mur et des casernes près de "
"cette route à intervalles réguliers. Veillez à construire des portails "
"sur la route afin que les soldats puissent affronter l'ennemi avant "
"qu'il ne soit dans la cité. \n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"#430Aide# / #447Histoire#"

