msgctxt "help/475/0"
msgid "Help with Barracks"
msgstr "Aide : Les Casernes"

msgctxt "help/475/1"
msgid ""
"Barracks send soldiers out to patrol the city in search of Barbarians "
"and rioters. Soldiers will take the initiative to attack and kill any "
"such undesirables. They will also enhance the security level of any "
"areas they walk past (within a range of a few map squares). Ironically, "
"although Barracks protect and serve the city, residents hate to live "
"near them, and they limit land value. Residential areas should ideally "
"have good road access to barracks, but be at least several squares away "
"from them.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"#476Tips# / #447 History#"
msgstr ""
"Les casernes envoient des soldats dans la ville à la recherche de "
"barbares et d'émeutiers. Les soldats prennent l'initiative d'attaquer "
"et tuer ces indésirables. Ils augmentent également la sécurité des "
"endroits qu'ils traversent (dans une plage de quelques carrés de "
"carte). Ironiquement, bien que les casernes protègent et servent la "
"cité, les habitants détestent vivre près d'elles, elles limitent le "
"coût foncier. Dans l'idéal, les quartiers résidentiels doivent posséder "
"un bon accès routier aux Casernes, mais être situés à quelques carrés "
"d'elles.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"#476Trucs# / #447 Histoire#"

msgctxt "help/476/0"
msgid "Tips for Barracks"
msgstr "Trucs : Les Casernes"

msgctxt "help/476/1"
msgid ""
"If you have built a wall around your city, you can better defend it by "
"building a road just inside the wall, and placing barracks next to that "
"road at regular intervals.  Make sure you build gates on the road as "
"well, so that your soldiers can reach enemies before they enter the "
"city. \n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"#475Help# / #447 History#"
msgstr ""
"Si vous avez construit un mur autour de la Cité, améliorez la défense "
"en construisant une route à l'intérieur du rempart et en y plaçant des "
"casernes à intervalles réguliers. N'oubliez pas d'ajouter des portails "
"pour que les soldats puissent attaquer l'ennemi avant qu'il soit dans "
"la ville. \n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"#475Aide# / #447 Histoire#"

