msgctxt "help/505/0"
msgid "Odeum"
msgstr "Odéon"

msgctxt "help/505/1"
msgid ""
"The Odeum is a larger type of theater, which serves a larger region "
"than the smaller version. Like the smaller Theaters, Odeums do not need "
"road access.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"#506Tips# / #492History#"
msgstr ""
"L'Odéon est un type de théâtre plus grand et qui dessert une zone plus "
"vaste que la version plus petite. Comme les petits théâtres l'Odéon n'a "
"pas besoin d'accès routier.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"#506Trucs# / #492Histoire#"

msgctxt "help/506/0"
msgid "Tips for Entertainment"
msgstr "Trucs: l'Odéon"

msgctxt "help/506/1"
msgid ""
"When you have access to improved entertainment, you should consider "
"\"upgrading\" the ones you have already built.  You can easily replace "
"your old ones with odeums and coliseums, as they take up the same "
"space.  On the other hand, the Circus Maximus is larger than the "
"Circus, so you should plan to clear extra space for it.\n"
"\n"
"If you can't afford to build the more expensive forms of entertainment, "
"you should still prepare space for them in your city.  For example, if "
"you try to arrange as many city blocks around a clearing that will "
"eventually hold a circus, than you won't need to build so many "
"circuses. \n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"#505Help# / #492History#"
msgstr ""
"Lorsque vous avez accès à une meilleure catégorie de loisirs, vous "
"devez envisager d'améliorer ceux qui existent déjà. Vous pouvez "
"aisément remplacer les anciens par des Odéons et des Colisées qui "
"occupent le même espace. D'un autre point de vue, le Cirque Maxime est "
"plus grand que le Cirque, vous devez donc lui libérer de la place.\n"
"\n"
"Si vous ne pouvez pas vous permettre de construire les formes de "
"loisirs les plus coûteuses, vous pouvez leur préparer un espace dans la "
"cité. Par exemple, si vous essayez d'agencer autant d'îlots que "
"possible autour d'un espace qui pourrait contenir un cirque, vous "
"n'aurez pas à construire autant de cirques. \n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"#505Aide# / #492Histoire#"

