msgctxt "help/520/0"
msgid "Help with Arenas"
msgstr "Aide: Arènes"

msgctxt "help/520/1"
msgid ""
"The Arena is a place where spectators come to watch staged fights "
"between captured enemies, wild animals, slaves, and so on. If a regular "
"arena ceases to adequately thrill your populace, you will eventually be "
"able to build the more advanced Colosseum, which will be accessible to "
"a wider area. Like the other Entertainment buildings, Arenas will raise "
"surrounding land values and will improve your city's Culture rating.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"#521Tips# / #522History#"
msgstr ""
"L'Arène est un endroit où les spectateurs se rendent pour regarder des "
"combats mis en scène entre des ennemis prisonniers, des animaux "
"sauvages, des esclaves, etc. Si une arène normale cesse de faire "
"frissonner votre populace, vous pouvez éventuellement construire le "
"Colisée le plus avancé, qui sera accessible dans un vaste rayon. Comme "
"les autres équipements de loisirs, l'arène fait monter le coût foncier "
"des terrains avoisinants et améliore l'indice culturel de la Cité.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"#521Trucs# / #522Histoire#"

