msgctxt "help/535/1"
msgid ""
"The Colosseum is the more advanced type of Arena. It is larger, and "
"serves a wider radius than the regular Arena. Like the other "
"Entertainment buildings, Colosseums will raise surrounding land values "
"and will improve your city's Culture rating.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"#536Tips# / #522History#"
msgstr ""
