msgctxt "help/565/0"
msgid "Circus Maximus"
msgstr "Cirque Maxime"

msgctxt "help/565/1"
msgid ""
"The Circus Maximus, a large circus, is an impressive building that will "
"draw huge crowds and impact a larger region than the regular circus. "
"Circuses are rectangular in shape, and you may place one in any "
"orientation in your city by using the rotate arrows on your control "
"panel. Like the other Entertainment buildings, circuses will raise "
"surrounding land values, and will boost your culture rating.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"#566Tips# / #552History#"
msgstr ""
"Le Cirque Maxime est un édifice impressionnant qui attire des foules "
"importantes et touche une grande région. Les cirques sont de forme "
"rectangulaire et vous pouvez les placer dans toute orientation avec les "
"flèches de rotation du panneau de contrôle. Comme les autres "
"équipements de loisirs, le cirque fait monter le coût foncier des "
"terrains avoisinants et améliore l'indice culturel de la Cité.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"#566Trucs# / #552Histoire#"

