msgctxt "help/700/0"
msgid "Help with Seas"
msgstr "Aide: les Mers"

msgctxt "help/700/1"
msgid ""
"The lands beyond your coastline may bring great wealth or great danger. "
"You may tap into the wealth that the sea has to offer by building ports "
"and shipyards to bring in ocean trade.\n"
"\n"
"But beware -- the tides may also bring enemies who will try to invade "
"your lands, destroy your industrial sources, and topple your government!"
msgstr ""
"Les contrées outre-mer peuvent apporter de grandes richesses ou de "
"grands dangers. Vous pouvez profiter des ressources maritimes en "
"construisant des ports et des chantiers navals pour commercer avec "
"l'océan.\n"
"\n"
"Mais attention -- la marée peut aussi amener des ennemis qui tenteront "
"d'envahir vos terres, détruiront vous ressources industrielles et "
"renverseront votre gouvernement!"

