msgctxt "help/715/1"
msgid ""
"You may not build walls, roads, or any other buildings or structures on "
"a mountainous area, nor can you move Cohorts through mountains. "
"Mountain ranges can, however, help to protect your city from enemy "
"forces, which will be unable to cross them. "
msgstr ""
"Vous ne pouvez pas construire de murs, de routes ou toute autre "
"structure ou immeuble sur une zone montagneuse, ni y faire manoeuvrer "
"vos Cohortes. Les montagnes peuvent cependant protéger votre cité "
"contre les forces ennemies qui ne pourront pas les traverser."

