msgctxt "help/760/0"
msgid "Help with the Capital City"
msgstr "Aide: la capitale"

msgctxt "help/760/1"
msgid ""
"Your Capital City is the focal point of your Province, and serves as "
"the arena for all game play on the City Level of Caesar II. You must "
"see to it that your Capital City is wealthy and safe, and that your "
"people lead rich, happy lives.\n"
"\n"
"On the Province Level, you will tend to issues that are on a different "
"scale than those of the City Level, but which will directly affect the "
"well-being of your Capital City. Any Industrial Sources (Mines, "
"Quarries, Farms, etc.) you build on the Province Level will feed your "
"Businesses and Markets on the City Level, and thus must be connected to "
"the city by road.\n"
"\n"
"#43Next Page#\n"
"#761Tips#"
msgstr ""
"Votre Capitale est le point essentiel de votre Province, elle sert "
"d'arène au jeu CAESAR II au niveau de la Cité. Elle doit être prospère "
"et sûre et les habitants doivent vivre riches et heureux.\n"
"\n"
"En Mode Campagne, vous devez résoudre des problèmes d'un autre niveau "
"que pour la Ville, mais ils affectent directement le bien-être de la "
"capitale. Toutes les sources industrielles (Mines, Carrières, Fermes, "
"etc.) alimentent vos industries et les marchés de la Cité, une route "
"doit les relier à la ville.\n"
"\n"
"#43Page Suivante#\n"
"#761Trucs#"

msgctxt "help/761/0"
msgid "Tips for the Capital City"
msgstr "Trucs: la capitale"

msgctxt "help/761/1"
msgid ""
"Consult the general game strategies under the Help menu for hints and "
"tips concerning city management.\n"
"\n"
"#760Help#"
msgstr ""
"Consultez les stratégies générales du menu Aide pour obtenir des "
"astuces sur la gestion de la ville.\n"
"\n"
"#760Aide#"

