msgctxt "help/790/0"
msgid "Help with Towns"
msgstr "Aide : Les villes"

msgctxt "help/790/1"
msgid ""
"Roman Towns are communities that are friendly toward the Roman Empire, "
"and welcome its authority. At the beginning of a game, however, these "
"Towns will be rather small and isolated from your Capital City.\n"
"\n"
"By building road connections between your Capital City and and any "
"outlying Towns, you will improve your business trade, and you will "
"likely see the Towns grow in size.\n"
"\n"
"#791Tips#"
msgstr ""
"Les villes romaines sont des communautés amicales envers l'Empire "
"romain, et accueillent son autorité. Au début du jeu, ces Villes sont "
"relativement petites et elles sont isolées de la capitale.\n"
"\n"
"En construisant une connexion routière entre la capitale et les villes, "
"vous améliorerez vos échanges commerciaux, et vous verrez sûrement la "
"taille des villes augmenter.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"#791Trucs#"

msgctxt "help/791/0"
msgid "Tips for Towns"
msgstr "Trucs : Les villes"

msgctxt "help/791/1"
msgid ""
"Connecting outlying towns to your city via provincial roads will help "
"the towns to grow and will improve the economy of your capital city. \n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"#790Help#"
msgstr ""
"Connecter des villes éloignées à votre cité par des routes provinciales "
"va aider ces villes à se développer et va améliorer l'économie de votre "
"capitale.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
