msgctxt "help/910/0"
msgid "Warehouses"
msgstr "Entrepôts"

msgctxt "help/910/1"
msgid ""
"Warehouses are needed by industrial sources to store excess goods. You "
"must build a Warehouse directly adjacent to its industrial source.  You "
"may build as many warehouses adjacent to industries, ports, and trading "
"posts as you need to store excess goods. You will be prompted to build "
"a warehouse, if appropriate, whenever you build an industrial source, "
"port, or shipyard.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"#896Tips#"
msgstr ""
"Les entrepôts aux sources industrielles stockant des produits en "
"surplus. Vous devez construire un entrepôt jouxtant directement sa "
"source. Vous pouvez construire autant d'entrepôts que vous le désirez "
"près des industries, des ports et des Comptoirs que vous voulez stocker "
"d'excédents. Il vous est demandé de créer un entrepôt, si nécessaire, "
"lors de la construction d'une source industrielle, d'un port ou d'un "
"chantier naval.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"#896Trucs#"

