msgctxt "help/925/0"
msgid "Help with Shipyards"
msgstr "Les chantiers navals"

msgctxt "help/925/1"
msgid ""
"Shipyards must be built adjacent to Ports. By producing ships, a "
"Shipyard will increase the productivity and output of its Port by "
"building more ships to trade with the nearest sea lane."
msgstr ""
"Les chantiers navals doivent être construits près des ports. En "
"construisant des bateaux, un chantier naval augmente la productivité de "
"son Port car les navires produits commerceront avec la voie maritime la "
"plus proche."

