msgctxt "help/940/0"
msgid "Help with Farms"
msgstr "Aide : Les fermes"

msgctxt "help/940/1"
msgid ""
"Farms can be placed on patches of Meadow, which are represented on the "
"map by flat, brown and green areas. You will not be able to place a "
"farm on anything other than Meadow land. When you place a farm, you "
"will be given a choice of what type of agriculture it should focus on "
"(i.e. wheat, grapes, cattle, etc.). The types of agriculture available "
"will vary from province to province. Farms must be connected to your "
"city by roads, and must be accompanied by both a Warehouse and a Work "
"Camp.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"#896Tips#"
msgstr ""
"Les fermes peuvent être placées sur les prés, représentés sur la carte "
"par des zones plates, marron et vertes. Vous ne pouvez pas placer de "
"ferme sur autre chose qu'une zone de prés. Lorsque vous placez une "
"ferme, on vous propose de choisir le type d'agriculture sur lequel vous "
"souhaitez vous concentrer (le blé, les vignes, le bétail, etc.). Les "
"types disponibles varient selon les provinces. Les fermes doivent être "
"reliées à votre Cité par des routes et doivent être accompagnées à la "
"fois d'un entrepôt et d'un chantier.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"#896Trucs#"

msgctxt "help/941/0"
msgid "Industries and Industrial Support"
msgstr "Industries et Support Industriel"

msgctxt "help/941/1"
msgid ""
"When selecting a site for an industry, make sure that it has plenty of "
"empty space next to it so that you can give it road access, a work camp "
"and one or more warehouses.  Some sites will have more accessibility "
"than others.\n"
"\n"
"Don't build more workcamps than you can easily fill with plebs; if you "
"do, all of your industries will suffer for it.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"#1108List Items#"
msgstr ""
"Lorsque vous sélectionnez un site industriel, assurez-vous qu'il "
"dispose d'un espace conséquent afin de lui donner un accès routier, un "
"chantier et un ou plusieurs Entrepôts. Certains sites sont plus "
"accessibles que les autres.\n"
"\n"
"Ne construisez pas trop de chantiers si vous ne pouvez pas leur "
"affecter des Plébéiens, sinon, vos industries en pâtiront.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"#1108Afficher la liste#"

