msgctxt "help/955/0"
msgid "Help with Mines"
msgstr "Aide: les Mines"

msgctxt "help/955/1"
msgid ""
"Mines can be placed on Rocky Areas, indicated by rocky patches on your "
"Province Map. As with farms, mining options will vary from province to "
"province. You may choose to mine lead, copper, gems, or iron. A Mine "
"needs road access, a Warehouse, and a Workhouse.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"#896Tips#"
msgstr ""
"Les mines peuvent être placées sur les zones rocheuses, indiquées par "
"des taches rocailleuses sur la carte de la Province. Comme pour les "
"fermes, les options des mines varient selon les provinces. Vous pouvez "
"choisir des mines de plomb, de cuivre, de pierres précieuses ou d'or. "
"Il vous faudra un accès routier, un entrepôt et un chantier.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
