msgstr "Ligne de texte factice."

msgctxt "help/1150/0"
msgid "All roads lead here..."
msgstr "Tous les chemins mènent ici..."

msgctxt "help/1151/0"
msgid ""
"Thanks to our recent campaigns, the people of this province have been "
"\"Romanized.\"  They should be placid and welcoming."
msgstr ""
"Grâce à nos campagnes dans la péninsule, la population de cette "
"province a été \"Romanisée\". Ils doivent être placides et bienveillants."

msgctxt "help/1152/0"
msgid ""
"This province is fairly quiet, but beware of occasional incursions of "
"the Gauls to the north."
msgstr ""
"Cette province est tranquille mais gare aux incursions occasionnelles "
"des Gaulois au nord."

msgctxt "help/1153/0"
msgid ""
"There is a slight barbarian presence in this province, but it is a "
"prime trading area with access to the spice routes."
msgstr ""
"Il y a une mince présence barbare dans cette province, mais c'est une "
"zone de commerce de choix avec accès à la route des épices."

msgctxt "help/1154/0"
msgid ""
"Your mission is to manage the small island of Sardinia, to the west of "
"Rome.  One of the outlying villages has not been tamed, so rule with "
"caution."
msgstr ""
"Votre mission est de gérer la petite île de Sardaigne, à l'ouest de "
"Rome. Un des villages isolés n'est pas civilisé, légiférez avec "
"précautions."

msgctxt "help/1155/0"
msgid ""
"This province contains a village of those rebellious Gauls; however, "
"they should be fairly peaceable for their lot."
msgstr ""
"Cette Province comprend un petit village de rebelles Gaulois, cependant "
"ils doivent être paisibles dans leur ensemble."

msgctxt "help/1156/0"
msgid ""
"This region's once-great cities have been razed.  Rebuild this province "
"to even greater splendor, but beware a fierce and unruly populace."
msgstr ""
"La Capitale de cette région a été rasée. Reconstruisez la province avec "
"splendeur mais gare à sa population violente et indisciplinée."

msgctxt "help/1157/0"
msgid ""
"This rich agricultural area is suitable for grapes and wheat, and its "
"ports should be a prime source of fish for the Empire."
msgstr ""
"Cette zone agricole est idéale pour la vigne et le blé et ses ports "
"devraient être une source de poisson de choix pour L'Empire."

msgctxt "help/1158/0"
msgid ""
"This province allows enemies to reach the Empire from the south.  "
"Taming it would limit their incursions, but the people here seem "
"displeased with our presence."
msgstr ""
"Cette province permet aux ennemis d'atteindre L'Empire par le sud. La "
"civiliser limiterait leurs incursions mais les gens ne semblent pas "
"heureux de notre présence."

msgctxt "help/1159/0"
msgid ""
"Surveys report the soil here to be rich with ores and gems, and the "
"seas a prime source of fish."
msgstr ""
"Des études rapportent que le sol d'ici doit être riche d'or et de "
"pierres précieuses, et la mer une source de poisson de choix."

msgctxt "help/1160/0"
msgid ""
"The Gauls may have an important presence here, but they are more -- "
"civilized -- than most of their kind.  Resources are plentiful here."
msgstr ""
"Présence Gauloise est importante ici, mais ils sont plus -- civilisés "
"--que la plupart des gens de leur race. Les ressources sont abondantes."

msgctxt "help/1161/0"
msgid ""
"As a southern province, this area would give us access to the ivory and "
"spice trading routes."
msgstr ""
"En tant que Province du sud, cette zone nous donne accès aux routes de "
"l'ivoire et des épices."

msgctxt "help/1162/0"
msgid ""
"Mineral resources are not plentiful here, but the people recognize our "
"right to rule more than most of these barbarous lands."
msgstr ""
"Les ressources minérales sont peu abondantes, mais les gens "
"reconnaissent plus notre autorité que dans la plupart de ces terres "
"barbares."

msgctxt "help/1163/0"
msgid ""
"The further north we expand, the fiercer the Gauls become.  However, "
"this region features some of the richest farmland the Empire has ever "
"seen."
msgstr ""
"Plus nous allons au nord, plus les Gaulois sont violents. Cependant, "
"cette région recèle les fermes les plus riches que l'Empire ait jamais vu."

msgctxt "help/1164/0"
msgid ""
"This province is suited for cattle and wheat.  Beware the Greeks to the "
"south."
msgstr ""
"Cette province est parfaite pour le bétail et le blé. Attention aux "
"Grecs au sud."

msgctxt "help/1165/0"
msgid ""
"The Greeks' constant squabbling have made it easy for us to conquer "
"them.  However, that same contentious behavior will make them more "
"difficult for you to rule."
msgstr ""
"Les chamailleries constantes des Grecs ont rendu leur conquête plus "
"facile. Cependant ce même comportement querelleur les rendra plus "
"difficiles à administrer."

msgctxt "help/1166/0"
msgid ""
"This island is small, yet rich in farmland and minerals.  However, the "
"populace may be troublesome."
msgstr ""
"Cette île est petite, riche en fermes et en minéraux. Cependant la "
"population peut causer des troubles."

msgctxt "help/1167/0"
msgid ""
"There is a significant barbarian presence in these lands, but they seem "
"more passive than most.  The true threat must lie further north."
msgstr ""
"Présence barbare significative sur ces terres, mais ils semblent plus "
"passifs que la plupart entre eux. Le vrai danger est à l'extrême nord."

msgctxt "help/1168/0"
msgid ""
"With the capacity for wheat farming in this province, this may be the "
"Empire's new breadbasket.  However, its inhabitants are less than "
"welcoming."
msgstr ""
"Avec la capacité en blé de cette Province, elle devrait être le nouveau "
"grenier de l'Empire. Cependant, ses habitants sont moins qu'accueillants."

msgctxt "help/1169/0"
msgid ""
"This region is rich in gems and other minerals, but among the mountains "
"lie many dangerous nomadic tribes."
msgstr ""
"Cette région est riche en pierres précieuses et autres minéraux, mais "
"près des montagnes se trouvent plusieurs dangereuses tribus nomades."

msgctxt "help/1170/0"
msgid ""
"Discontent is high in this area, which will make exploiting its "
"resources difficult."
msgstr ""
"Fort mécontentement dans cette zone, ce qui rend l'exploitation des "
"ressources difficile."

msgctxt "help/1171/0"
msgid ""
"This remote and rather rustic island offers some worthwhile exports, "
"but will have to remain well-defended to keep its rebellious populace "
"at bay."
msgstr ""
"Cette île lointaine et rustique offre quelques valeurs exportables , "
"mais elle doit rester bien défendue pour maintenir les populations "
"rebelles dans la baie."

msgctxt "help/1172/0"
msgid ""
"Minerals are less prevalent here, and unrest will likely be a problem.  "
"Exercise caution when governing here."
msgstr ""
"Les minéraux sont moins abondants ici, et l'agitation est un problème. "
"Gouvernez ici avec prudence."

msgctxt "help/1173/0"
msgid ""
"This province is poised to become the most prosperous one in this "
"region, with plenty of farming and mineral resources."
msgstr ""
"Cette province a la classe pour devenir la plus prospère de la région, "
"avec d'abondantes ressources agricoles et minérales."

msgctxt "help/1174/0"
msgid ""
"This region looks promising, but the further east we expand, the more "
"powerful our enemies seem to become."
msgstr ""
"Cette région est prometteuse, mais plus nous allons vers l'est, plus "
"nos ennemis semblent devenir puissants."

msgctxt "help/1175/0"
msgid ""
"This province contains some villages that may cause trouble, but "
"overall it seems fairly quiet."
msgstr ""
"Cette province comporte des villages qui peuvent causer des troubles, "
"mais dans l'ensemble elle semble tranquille."

msgctxt "help/1176/0"
msgid ""
"This province suffers from a lack of good farmland, and is threatened "
"by harassment from the north."
msgstr ""
"Cette province souffre de l'absence de bonnes terres, et elle est "
"menacée par les harassements du nord."

msgctxt "help/1177/0"
msgid ""
"The people here are prone to rebellion, and have settled in many of the "
"outlying towns.  You must pacify the province, if you expect to keep "
"peace in your city."
msgstr ""
"Ici, le peuple prône la rébellion et a colonisé beaucoup de villes "
"isolées. Vous devez pacifier la province, si vous espérez conserver la "
"paix dans votre cité."

msgctxt "help/1178/0"
msgid ""
"This culture seems ripe for assimilation into our Empire, but the "
"threat of attack from the north looms over it."
msgstr ""
"Cette culture semble prête pour l'assimilation dans l'Empire, mais la "
"menace d'attaque venue du nord pèse sur elle."

msgctxt "help/1179/0"
msgid ""
"The soil is quite fertile here, but the barbarian population is "
"significant.  Expect trouble."
msgstr ""
"Le sol est assez fertile mais la population barbare est conséquente. "
"Attendez-vous à des troubles."

msgctxt "help/1180/0"
msgid ""
"The people here are strong, but seem willing to join the Empire.  "
"Beware invasions from the north."
msgstr ""
"Ici les gens sont forts mais semblent désireux de rejoindre l'Empire. "
"Attention aux invasions venues du nord."

msgctxt "help/1181/0"
msgid ""
"This northern province contains a large barbarian presence, but its "
"resources seem worth the danger."
msgstr ""
"Les barbares sont largement présents dans cette province du nord, mais "
"ses ressources valent ce danger."

msgctxt "help/1182/0"
msgid ""
"Farmland seems plentiful here, but the barbarians are also plentiful "
"and unwilling to join the Empire."
msgstr ""
"Les terres semblent abondantes ici, mais les barbares le sont tout "
"autant et peu désireux de rejoindre l'Empire."

msgctxt "help/1183/0"
msgid ""
"Resources are scarce on this small island, and the people look to be "
"difficult to manage.  Maintain vigilance."
msgstr ""
"Les ressources sont peu abondantes sur cette petite île et les gens "
"semblent être difficiles à administrer. Maintenir la vigilance."

msgctxt "help/1184/0"
msgid ""
"Surveys show little in the way of resources, and resistance to the "
"Empire is strong here."
msgstr ""
"Les études indiquent peu de ressources et la résistance à l'Empire est "
"forte."

msgctxt "help/1185/0"
msgid ""
"This region is a dangerous mix of excellent mineral resources and "
"rebellious villages.  Exploit the trade routes, and defend your capital "
"city."
msgstr ""
"Cette région est un dangereux mélange d'excellentes ressources "
"minérales et de villages rebelles. Exploitez les routes commerçantes et "
"défendez votre capitale."

msgctxt "help/1186/0"
msgid ""
"This tiny empire may be good for little else but fish and frustration.  "
"Emperor, its inhabitants will bring you nothing but trouble."
msgstr ""
"Ce petit Empire n'apporte que du poisson et de la frustration. "
"Empereur, ses habitants n'apporteront rien d'autre que des troubles."

msgctxt "help/1187/0"
msgid ""
"Are you sure this a good idea?  Shouldn't we just wall off the northern "
"border of Britannia and be done with it?"
msgstr ""
"Etes-vous sûr que c'est une bonne idée, César? ne devrions nous pas "
"murer la frontière nord de la Bretagne et nous en tenir là?"

msgctxt "help/1188/0"
msgid ""
"We've beaten back those upstart barbarians, and these lands are bereft "
"of minerals.  Perhaps it's best to leave sleeping dogs lie?"
msgstr ""
"Nous avons battu ces barbares arrivistes et ces terres sont privées de "
"minéraux. Il est peut-être sage de ne pas réveiller le chat qui dort."

msgctxt "help/1189/0"
msgid ""
"Many barbarians have resettled in this area, thanks to our previous "
"campaigns.  Expanding into these lands would only give them a chance at "
"revenge -- in my humble opinion."
msgstr ""
"De nombreux barbares ont re-colonisé cette zone, grâce à nos campagnes "
"antérieures. Notre expansion dans ces terres ne leur donnera qu'une "
"chance de revanche -- à mon humble avis César."

msgctxt "help/1190/0"
msgid ""
"Aside from imported silks, is there anything to be gained from this "
"conquest but bloodshed?"
msgstr ""
"A part les soieries importées, y a t'il autre chose à gagner dans cette "
"conquête qu'un carnage?"

msgctxt "help/1191/0"
msgid ""
"Our scouts in Dacia indicate that this area would be extremely "
"difficult to tame, though its silk trade and fishing waters are tempting."
msgstr ""
"Nos éclaireurs en Dacie indiquent que cette région sera très difficile "
"à pacifier, bien que son commerce de soieries et ses eaux poissonneuses "
"soient tentants."

msgctxt "help/1192/0"
msgid ""
"Farming is difficult here, and our enemies are plentiful.  Are this "
"land's meager benefits worth provoking them further?"
msgstr ""
"Ici, la culture est difficile et nos ennemis sont nombreux. Les maigres "
"bénéfices de ce pays auront-ils une valeur plus tard ?"

msgctxt "help/1193/0"
msgid ""
"This land is barren, and the Huns who travel across it are nearly a "
"match for our own troops!  I beg you to reconsider!"
msgstr ""
"Ce pays est stérile, et les Huns qui le traversent sont pratiquement "
"égaux à nos propres troupes! César, je vous supplie de reconsidérer la "
"question."

msgctxt "help/1194/0"
